// A directory at the plate path is not the plate.
// The read ignores it. An empty directory is removed on write.
// A directory that still holds a name stays.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE notdir ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law    ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG notdir law

IMPULSE notdir 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "notdir" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
